    "upstream.v165.message191":
        "Remove the image background while preserving the complete outline, details, and edges of this layer's target, and output a transparent background. Target: {p0}. {p1}This reference image has already extracted this layer; remove only non-target content. If the target is a full photo, card, or panel, preserve the entire panel and all opaque scenes, subjects, borders, and rounded corners inside it. Make only the area outside the panel transparent; do not cut out the subject inside the photo. Preserve the reference image's full canvas size, target position, proportions, and ground shadow. Do not crop, center, or redraw other objects. Output PNG; blank areas must be alpha=0. Do not draw a checkerboard or solid-color background to imitate transparency.",
